2
00:01:36,766 --> 00:01:38,000
I'm Gigi Murin.

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,933
I used to be 14 years old in 8th grade, but now I'm not!

4
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,833
I'm a bit clumsy, crazy, and silly,

5
00:01:44,833 --> 00:01:48,866
and I may not look it, but actually, I'm a member of Hololive English -Justice-.

6
00:01:48,866 --> 00:01:50,133
That's true!

7
00:01:50,933 --> 00:01:54,000
You can call me the Fister, because of my big, big power glove...

8
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,333
People don't really like that I call myself the Fister, and I don't really know why...

9
00:02:06,333 --> 00:02:10,966
...literally called the Fister, because I fist people, you know? You know what I mean?

10
00:02:11,066 --> 00:02:14,600
Today is the day of a very important Justice meeting,

11
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,833
but I... I accidentally overslept!

12
00:02:16,833 --> 00:02:20,100
So I have to hurry up and make sure to look both ways

13
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:24,066
before crossing the road, and... go!

14
00:02:24,066 --> 00:02:27,466
Gigi goes flying!

15
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:35,800
Ouch! Who is that? Why is it so weird?

16
00:02:38,766 --> 00:02:41,833
Wow. Where am I?

17
00:02:42,066 --> 00:02:44,966
A... beautiful 2D fantasy world?

18
00:02:45,066 --> 00:02:48,066
I was supposed to get hit by a car,

19
00:02:48,066 --> 00:02:51,600
and get Isekai'd...

20
00:02:58,266 --> 00:03:00,600
Get hit by a car and it would be really cool... What the...

21
00:03:01,466 --> 00:03:04,166
A horse?! That's not a truck!

22
00:03:04,166 --> 00:03:06,900
That's dangerous! I could've died!

23
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:10,066
But phew... That grem sure knows how to drive!

24
00:03:10,066 --> 00:03:12,733
Gremlin driver—

25
00:03:22,033 --> 00:03:26,566
Ow... My body hurts...

26
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:33,400
I feel like I got run over by something, but I don't know what...

27
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:38,600
Oh. Is that a statue of a grem? Looks cool.

28
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:44,800
Wait a second... I know this! I've been Isekai'd!

29
00:03:45,933 --> 00:03:49,033
What the freak? Gigi, you're hit too?

30
00:03:49,033 --> 00:03:52,000
Justice cardboard?

31
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,700
Gigi, what's going on? Where are we?

32
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,733
What are you guys doing? Why are you cardboard?

33
00:03:59,733 --> 00:04:02,933
Wow, CC looks so flat!

34
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:08,533
You f***ing b***h! How dare you do this to me! You b***h! This is your fault somehow! I don't know how you did this,

35
00:04:08,533 --> 00:04:12,433
you little dumb b***h! Oh, you look terrible!

36
00:04:13,733 --> 00:04:17,000
Well, let's go investigate around here.

37
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,433
Yeah, let's go. / Okay!

38
00:04:18,533 --> 00:04:24,033
I'm on my way! Wait, guys! Wait for me! We can have an adventure together!

39
00:04:24,033 --> 00:04:29,633
We can have an adventure together, and it'll be so fun! And...

40
00:04:29,633 --> 00:04:34,000
Wait... Wait... What's going on?

41
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:41,900
Horses! Two of them!

42
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:57,066
Goodbye, leaving heartache of the past behind

43
00:04:57,066 --> 00:05:00,000
There's no more turning back

44
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:02,308
Looking back, it's time

45
00:05:02,308 --> 00:05:05,108
Moving down our own path

46
00:05:05,108 --> 00:05:08,308
Evermore voyaging forward to make

47
00:05:08,308 --> 00:05:12,008
this journey last...

48
00:05:30,008 --> 00:05:33,708
Never spoken about in the light

49
00:05:33,708 --> 00:05:36,708
Like a promise found riding the wind

50
00:05:36,708 --> 00:05:40,808
Where a path begins spiraling outward and up

51
00:05:40,808 --> 00:05:44,808
An inspiring tale begins

52
00:05:44,808 --> 00:05:48,008
We who dare defy changing of times

53
00:05:48,008 --> 00:05:52,008
As we follow unreachable dreams

54
00:05:52,008 --> 00:05:55,708
Now it's here and right now that we're drawn to somehow

55
00:05:55,708 --> 00:06:00,008
Deep inside a will to live that won't leave

56
00:06:00,008 --> 00:06:03,008
With all this aching

57
00:06:03,008 --> 00:06:09,808
Wandering near and far, touching lives just like ours

58
00:06:09,808 --> 00:06:15,808
Lighting fires till I'm wasted away

59
00:06:15,808 --> 00:06:20,808
One day, I'll recall these nights

60
00:06:20,808 --> 00:06:24,808
Our relentless odyssey

61
00:06:24,808 --> 00:06:28,008
Pressing onward, we never surrender

62
00:06:28,008 --> 00:06:36,008
Toward the skies, we can rise again

63
00:06:51,508 --> 00:07:00,008
I WAS HIT BY A TRUCK AND REINCARNATED AS THE PROTAGONIST IN A FANTASY WORLD BUT THEN A HORSE RAN ME OVER AND NOW ALL MY FRIENDS ARE CARDBOARD?
[Title: I WAS HIT BY A TRUCK AND REINCARNATED AS THE PROTAGONIST IN A FANTASY WORLD BUT THEN A HORSE RAN ME OVER AND NOW ALL MY FRIENDS ARE CARDBOARD?]

64
00:07:07,508 --> 00:07:11,808
If anything else hits me, I don't think I'll survive much longer.

65
00:07:11,808 --> 00:07:14,308
I really need to be more careful.

66
00:07:14,308 --> 00:07:17,308
Thank goodness I'm still alive.

67
00:07:19,008 --> 00:07:24,008
The winds whispered of your coming...

68
00:07:24,508 --> 00:07:28,208
...and now, here you are.

69
00:07:29,008 --> 00:07:30,808
Who are you?

70
00:07:30,808 --> 00:07:36,508
I am the greatest wizard in all of Grem Kingdom.

71
00:07:36,808 --> 00:07:39,008
Wizard Oji-chan.

72
00:07:39,008 --> 00:07:41,208
Wizard Oji-chan?

73
00:07:41,208 --> 00:07:43,508
Are you Wizard or Oji-chan?

74
00:07:43,508 --> 00:07:46,008
Is that a name? What should I call you?

75
00:07:46,008 --> 00:07:51,008
So many of Grem's warriors have fallen, one by one,

76
00:07:51,008 --> 00:07:54,808
while we waited for your arrival...

77
00:07:54,808 --> 00:07:55,608
Okay.

78
00:07:55,608 --> 00:07:57,608
The wait was worth it!

79
00:07:57,608 --> 00:08:03,508
You are far more powerful than I ever imagined a hero could be!

80
00:08:03,508 --> 00:08:05,508
He's not responding to me.

81
00:08:05,508 --> 00:08:08,208
He's probably an NPC. Is this a game?

82
00:08:08,508 --> 00:08:10,308
NPC?!

83
00:08:10,308 --> 00:08:13,508
ちょっと... ちょっと待ってください...
Wait... Wait a second...

84
00:08:13,508 --> 00:08:16,008
Oh, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

85
00:08:16,008 --> 00:08:20,508
Wizard! Oji-chan!

86
00:08:20,508 --> 00:08:24,508
I'm sorry, I didn't know you could talk!

87
00:08:25,508 --> 00:08:27,008
You're the key.

88
00:08:27,008 --> 00:08:34,508
Without you, your friend and this world are lost...

89
00:08:34,508 --> 00:08:37,508
What? Lost? What are you talking about?

90
00:08:38,008 --> 00:08:39,508
Gigi...

91
00:08:39,508 --> 00:08:42,508
...the world is waiting...

92
00:08:42,508 --> 00:08:44,808
He knows my name! That's me!

93
00:08:44,808 --> 00:08:51,008
I'm the hero! I'm gonna save the world from being cardboard!

94
00:08:52,508 --> 00:08:54,808
Huzzah!

95
00:08:57,008 --> 00:09:00,508
What did you do to me?! It hurts! It hurts!

96
00:09:01,008 --> 00:09:02,808
ちょっと... ちょっと...
Wait... Hold on...

97
00:09:02,808 --> 00:09:05,508
What are you saying?

98
00:09:05,508 --> 00:09:07,008
Huzzah!

99
00:09:09,508 --> 00:09:14,508
Wow! I'm so cute and soft and fluffy now! Friends with you! Purchase next time they're in stock!

100
00:09:14,508 --> 00:09:20,008
ちょっと... 痛い痛い... ごめん、もう一回... 日本語ちゃんとやるから...
Wait... that hurt... Sorry, one more time... I'll do the Japanese properly...

101
00:09:20,008 --> 00:09:21,808
I don't understand!

102
00:09:21,808 --> 00:09:23,508
Okay, okay, okay!

103
00:09:23,508 --> 00:09:28,008
Is he gonna do it again? Whoa, he's really getting into this!

104
00:09:28,008 --> 00:09:31,008
行け！行け！
Go! Go!

105
00:09:31,008 --> 00:09:33,508
Squeak! Squeak squeak!

106
00:09:33,508 --> 00:09:36,508
Not squeak, squeak! What's that?!

107
00:09:36,508 --> 00:09:39,008
行くぞ！
Here I go!

108
00:09:39,008 --> 00:09:40,008
I'm ready!

109
00:09:40,008 --> 00:09:43,508
時空！時空包陣！
Time-space! Time-space sealing spell!

110
00:09:43,508 --> 00:09:44,508
Do it!

111
00:09:51,008 --> 00:09:54,508
Ugh...

112
00:09:54,508 --> 00:09:59,008
Oh, wait! I can move now! What is...

113
00:10:01,016 --> 00:10:02,016
What is this?

114
00:10:02,516 --> 00:10:06,516
Hands? You did it! You've done it!

115
00:10:07,816 --> 00:10:11,216
Oh my god, look how cute I am!

116
00:10:11,816 --> 00:10:16,816
Aw, I've always been cute, but now... now it's even cuter! Now everyone can see how cute I...

117
00:10:16,816 --> 00:10:18,816
Look at that fat tail! Look at that fat tail!

118
00:10:18,916 --> 00:10:20,816
I can do everything!

119
00:10:20,816 --> 00:10:22,016
I can't do that.

120
00:10:22,516 --> 00:10:24,516
Watch this, guys. You've never seen this before.

121
00:10:24,816 --> 00:10:28,516
Okay, okay... Wheee! Wheee! I can do everything.

122
00:10:28,516 --> 00:10:30,516
Two in a row? Just kidding.

123
00:10:30,516 --> 00:10:32,516
I have a world to save.

124
00:10:32,516 --> 00:10:34,516
Look at that, everyone loves me!

125
00:10:35,016 --> 00:10:36,516
Gigi Murin!

126
00:10:39,516 --> 00:10:43,016
[Wizard grunting]

127
00:10:43,516 --> 00:10:49,016
Is he...

128
00:10:49,516 --> 00:10:53,016
Oh, I'm so dizzy... Oh, I'm so sorry.

129
00:10:54,516 --> 00:10:57,516
What... what should I do to save everyone?

130
00:10:59,516 --> 00:11:04,016
Oh, the world is spinning... Owie...

131
00:11:06,016 --> 00:11:12,016
Before saving everyone, let's see if you can survive basic chores.

132
00:11:12,016 --> 00:11:14,016
Basic cho-- I can do basic chores!

133
00:11:16,016 --> 00:11:18,516
Let's start with...

134
00:11:19,516 --> 00:11:21,216
Start with what?

135
00:11:21,816 --> 00:11:23,516
Start with what?

136
00:11:23,516 --> 00:11:25,816
What? What are we starting with?

137
00:11:26,516 --> 00:11:31,516
Eagles! Go, eagles! Go!

138
00:11:31,516 --> 00:11:34,516
Wait! What? What is he doing? What is he doing with the eagles?

139
00:11:35,016 --> 00:11:40,016
Go, go, go, set on them!

140
00:11:40,516 --> 00:11:45,016
Please wait! Wait! No! No!

141
00:11:49,516 --> 00:11:54,516
The birds took him! I knew I could never trust a bird!

142
00:11:55,016 --> 00:11:57,516
Hey you, Come here! Follow me!

143
00:11:57,616 --> 00:11:58,816
A grem!

144
00:11:59,016 --> 00:12:02,516
Um, I have to help my... my friends.

145
00:12:03,016 --> 00:12:06,516
You're scared and lost... Not knowing what to do, right?

146
00:12:07,016 --> 00:12:09,816
I'll show you how to save your friends. Follow me!

147
00:12:10,016 --> 00:12:11,816
Oh, okay!

148
00:12:12,516 --> 00:12:15,516
So small!

149
00:12:24,016 --> 00:12:27,516
This place is weird.

150
00:12:28,016 --> 00:12:31,216
This place is dark and it smells bad!

151
00:12:31,516 --> 00:12:35,516
Hey it smells good!!!! Do exactly as I say if you want to save your friends!

152
00:12:36,016 --> 00:12:40,016
Go to the Grem Kingdom and return with the One Ping, a Honkshoe, and a Straw Hat.

153
00:12:40,016 --> 00:12:41,816
Why do you need them?

154
00:12:42,016 --> 00:12:47,016
YOU DON'T GET TO ASK ME ANY QUESTIONS!!! NOW GO GIGI, GOOOOOO!!

155
00:12:47,516 --> 00:12:49,016
Okay.

156
00:13:01,516 --> 00:13:03,516
Woah!

157
00:13:03,516 --> 00:13:05,816
So this is the Grem Kingdom?

158
00:13:06,016 --> 00:13:09,816
It's so cool! There's so many grems!

159
00:13:10,016 --> 00:13:14,016
Does this mean this entire kingdom is mine if I save it?

160
00:13:15,016 --> 00:13:17,016
Woah, so many of you!

161
00:13:17,516 --> 00:13:20,816
Oh, not all at once. No, no, no, no. What?

162
00:13:22,016 --> 00:13:24,016
Oh, I can't hear you. Let's try this grem.

163
00:13:25,016 --> 00:13:27,816
Lucky little grem, what's on your mind?

164
00:13:29,016 --> 00:13:33,016
Things aren't going well with my partner... I need your help to fix our relationship.

165
00:13:33,516 --> 00:13:36,516
Aw... That is not my problem.

166
00:13:37,516 --> 00:13:41,516
Ah, okay. How about this grem? Do you have anything interesting to say to me?

167
00:13:42,016 --> 00:13:47,016
My tummy is getting very large and I don't know why. Please come with me to the doctor.

168
00:13:49,016 --> 00:13:53,016
Okay, a little inside secret... pregnant.

169
00:13:53,516 --> 00:13:55,516
Okay, how about this one?

170
00:13:56,016 --> 00:13:59,516
Make a contract with me, and become a magical girl!

171
00:13:59,816 --> 00:14:04,016
Oh, that is not my problem either. Oh, no no no no no. I will not be doing that.

172
00:14:04,016 --> 00:14:08,016
I know what happens when you sign a contract.

173
00:14:08,016 --> 00:14:10,516
You should never put your name down on things.

174
00:14:10,816 --> 00:14:12,816
Well, these grems were useless.

175
00:14:13,016 --> 00:14:20,516
I think if I use my RPG knowledge, you're supposed to get information from NPCs... at a store!

176
00:14:20,816 --> 00:14:23,516
And there's so many stalls near me!

177
00:14:23,816 --> 00:14:25,516
Ah, let's go to this one.

178
00:14:28,516 --> 00:14:31,516
So cute! Aw!

179
00:14:32,016 --> 00:14:35,016
Are you a little worker grem? Aw...

180
00:14:35,516 --> 00:14:37,516
How much do you make an hour?

181
00:14:38,016 --> 00:14:40,516
Do you make enough to survive? Aw...

182
00:14:41,016 --> 00:14:44,516
Oh! What is this? Mmm... For me?

183
00:14:47,016 --> 00:14:49,816
Uh, that's decorative hay, not edible...

184
00:14:54,016 --> 00:14:56,016
Can I ask you something?

185
00:14:57,516 --> 00:14:59,516
Oh, what is this? Dialogue!

186
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:01,824
Box?

187
00:15:02,824 --> 00:15:06,024
Um... Where can I get The One Ping?

188
00:15:21,224 --> 00:15:23,224
Mm... Okay, yeah.

189
00:15:23,224 --> 00:15:29,824
I- I can do that quest for you. Don't worry, I am the chosen one!

190
00:15:30,524 --> 00:15:34,024
Ah! A ring! Wow!

191
00:15:35,024 --> 00:15:38,824
I don't know what a volcano is. How is this supposed to help me save Justice?

192
00:15:39,024 --> 00:15:44,024
They're gonna die! They're gonna die if a volcano erupts! Oh wait, I don't know what a volcano is.

193
00:15:44,224 --> 00:15:46,524
Let's just try to find The One Ping myself.

194
00:15:48,024 --> 00:15:51,524
Wait, this box looks a little suspicious.

195
00:15:53,824 --> 00:15:58,524
Hmm. "Deliver to weapon shop."

196
00:15:58,824 --> 00:16:01,824
Oh, cool! So another quest?

197
00:16:03,824 --> 00:16:05,024
Okay!

198
00:16:11,524 --> 00:16:14,224
Hey! I got a package!

199
00:16:14,224 --> 00:16:18,024
I got you guys a package! It's a gift from me!

200
00:16:18,224 --> 00:16:23,224
I bought this. I'll just leave it right here. Yeah!

201
00:16:27,224 --> 00:16:30,024
Your BL novels?!

202
00:16:30,824 --> 00:16:36,224
No, no. No. Don't- don't lose sight of the quest, Gigi.

203
00:16:36,224 --> 00:16:42,524
Whoa! This is a really cool sword! I bet- I bet I could save Justice with-

204
00:16:44,224 --> 00:16:50,824
Why is this so heavy for cardboard?

205
00:16:51,024 --> 00:16:53,024
Oh! Oh my god!

206
00:16:53,224 --> 00:16:55,224
I'm- I'm gonna put it back.

207
00:16:55,224 --> 00:16:58,824
Oof! This is why- this is why Liz has so much arm strength!

208
00:16:58,824 --> 00:17:00,024
Oh my god!

209
00:17:04,224 --> 00:17:07,024
That sword's really cool! How much is it?

210
00:17:09,524 --> 00:17:13,824
What's that? $5?!

211
00:17:14,524 --> 00:17:16,824
Uh, I can't afford that.

212
00:17:17,224 --> 00:17:21,824
But, uh, how about- how about I save them through the power of friendship?!

213
00:17:22,024 --> 00:17:24,024
Oh, another- another text box.

214
00:17:24,824 --> 00:17:27,524
Is The One Ping even real?

215
00:17:34,224 --> 00:17:36,824
Okay. Sounds easy. I can do that.

216
00:17:44,224 --> 00:17:49,824
W- What? I- I don't think that's how you craft an iron bar.

217
00:17:55,224 --> 00:17:58,024
When did I get over here? What are these sunglasses?

218
00:17:58,224 --> 00:18:03,824
Grems, this- this beat's kind of nasty! Who let you have this in the shoe shop?

219
00:18:04,224 --> 00:18:12,024
Oh! Oh, okay! Okay, I'm- I'm getting it! Oh, okay! I guess- I guess we're really doing this! Haha! Okay!

220
00:18:13,224 --> 00:18:16,224
Set on a quest to save my friends! I don't really know what rhymes with friends!

221
00:18:16,224 --> 00:18:20,524
Old man wizard, take it from me! Evil flying birds looking for a treat!

222
00:18:20,524 --> 00:18:25,024
Don't even know if he's alive or not! But who really cares with the pelmets that I got?!

223
