575
00:40:06,064 --> 00:40:09,764
Well, I only have one thing here, and it's toast.

576
00:40:09,764 --> 00:40:12,364
Wow, you're so amazing. Did you make the bread yourself, too?

577
00:40:13,764 --> 00:40:14,964
