586
00:40:34,764 --> 00:40:36,064
Flip it!

587
00:40:37,064 --> 00:40:39,764
Yes! You're amazing!

588
00:40:40,064 --> 00:40:42,564
Ah, that made me really hungry.

589
00:40:42,564 --> 00:40:44,264
Do you mind if I eat this toast first?

590
00:40:44,264 --> 00:40:45,764
Of course you can. Anything for you.

591
00:40:45,764 --> 00:40:47,864
Really? You're such a sweet wife.

592
00:40:54,864 --> 00:40:57,264
I have to use the bathroom, my sweet.

593
00:40:57,264 --> 00:40:58,264
Oh, of course.

594
00:40:58,264 --> 00:41:00,664
By all means, anything you need.

595
00:41:03,564 --> 00:41:06,864
