607
00:41:45,664 --> 00:41:47,464
You're so thoughtful.

608
00:41:47,464 --> 00:41:51,064
Well, Nerissa Ravencroft, I've been doing a lot of thinking while I was on the toilet.

609
00:41:51,064 --> 00:41:51,764
