So delicious!

642
00:42:58,064 --> 00:42:59,064
Is it tasty?

643
00:42:59,064 --> 00:43:00,664
It's so tasty!

644
00:43:00,664 --> 00:43:02,064
Skibidi Toilet!

645
00:43:02,064 --> 00:43:05,764
Never has there been bread made this amazing!

646
00:43:07,864 --> 00:43:11,264
I'm glad that I made such a beautiful toast for you.

647
00:43:11,264 --> 00:43:12,864
Me too!

648
00:43:12,864 --> 00:43:14,264
It was my first time... Hey!

649
00:43:14,264 --> 00:43:15,364
