650
00:43:15,364 --> 00:43:16,164
All of it?

651
00:43:16,164 --> 00:43:17,664
All of it, it's all in my stomach.

652
00:43:17,664 --> 00:43:18,664
Was it really yummy?

653
00:43:18,664 --> 00:43:19,964
So delicious.

654
00:43:19,964 --> 00:43:20,964
I'm glad.

655
00:43:20,964 --> 00:43:22,064
Me too.

656
00:43:22,064 --> 00:43:27,064
I was really, really nervous. I still am nervous, 'cause you're so beautiful...

657
