Well, don't worry.

662
00:43:32,764 --> 00:43:35,064
...and there's so much wrong with me. But you're... there's everything right with you!

663
00:43:35,064 --> 00:43:37,064
But that's how I feel about you!

664
00:43:37,064 --> 00:43:37,864
Really?

665
