693
00:44:48,464 --> 00:44:50,964
I've never done this before!

694
00:44:50,964 --> 00:44:57,264
You know, Gigi, the truth is, I know I said I'd teach you anything, but I've never done this before either.

695
00:44:57,264 --> 00:44:58,264
Really?

696
00:44:58,264 --> 00:45:00,064
Then how are we supposed to do it if you've never...

697
00:45:00,072 --> 00:45:02,272
