698
00:45:02,872 --> 00:45:05,172
We are going to learn together.

699
00:45:05,372 --> 00:45:06,972
You can just learn from nothing?

700
00:45:07,072 --> 00:45:07,972
Of course.

701
00:45:07,972 --> 00:45:09,372
That's so... You can just do that?

702
00:45:09,372 --> 00:45:10,572
We'll find it out.

703
00:45:10,572 --> 00:45:13,072
How do you think the first humans learned things, Gigi?

704
00:45:13,172 --> 00:45:14,472
I don't know!

705
00:45:14,872 --> 00:45:17,072
Why are you asking me that?!

706
00:45:17,172 --> 00:45:19,272
Philosophical, it's pillow talk. Anyway...

707
00:45:19,372 --> 00:45:20,772
Oh, oh, okay.

708
00:45:20,972 --> 00:45:22,272
Well, shall we?

709
00:45:22,272 --> 00:45:29,872
