00:59:13,388 --> 00:59:15,288
Look and behold, Legends Foretold

982
00:59:15,388 --> 00:59:18,088
She is The Brave, souls will be saved

983
00:59:15,888 --> 00:59:17,588
I can do anything!

984
00:59:18,188 --> 00:59:20,088
Please do not stare, crazy footwear

985
00:59:18,888 --> 00:59:21,088
Yeah! Yeah, I can do it all!

986
00:59:20,188 --> 00:59:22,088
She packs a punch, munch them for lunch

987
00:59:21,288 --> 00:59:24,588
Okay, what should I do, Grems?

988
00:59:22,188 --> 00:59:24,888
From near and far, hit by a car

989
00:59:25,088 --> 00:59:27,088
Joy she will bring, Grems they will sing

990
00:59:26,588 --> 00:59:30,088
I know! Through the power of interpretive dance!

991
00:59:27,188 --> 00:59:29,088
Nothing to fear, Gigi is here

992
00:59:29,188 --> 00:59:31,088
Joy she will bring, Grems they will sing

993
00:59:30,188 --> 00:59:33,888
That's the only way we can destroy a dragon!

994
00:59:31,188 --> 00:59:33,888
Nothing to fear, Gigi is here

995
00:59:34,088 --> 00:59:40,888
Gremurin, come outside to pray, oh

996
00:59:34,088 --> 00:59:37,588
Because it hasn't been taking physical damage!

997
00:59:37,688 --> 00:59:41,288
So the best way to defeat it is through mental damage!

998
00:59:41,088 --> 00:59:45,088
gremurin, gremurin

999
00:59:41,888 --> 00:59:45,088
I've never done a worm before. I'm about to do a worm!

1000
00:59:49,888 --> 00:59:50,888
Is it working?

1001
00:59:50,088 --> 00:59:51,088
Help! Call the guard

1002
00:59:51,188 --> 00:59:52,888
Grems come and pray

1003
00:59:52,988 --> 00:59:54,888
Danger is here, a dragons appear

1004
00:59:53,888 --> 00:59:55,288
Oh, sorry, Grems! I'm sorry!

1005
00:59:55,088 --> 00:59:57,088
She is The Brave, souls will be saved

1006
00:59:57,188 --> 01:00:00,088
Please do not stare, crazy footwear

1007
01:00:01,196 --> 01:00:02,896
I- I'm not an interpretive dancer!

1008
01:00:09,396 --> 01:00:11,296
Did- Did you see here? Don't worry!

1009
01:00:12,496 --> 01:00:15,096
Another cartwheel! A second one even!

1010
01:00:15,696 --> 01:00:18,096
Yeah! And then- and then a worm!

1011
01:00:19,496 --> 01:00:21,896
Is it working? Is the dragon being...

1012
01:00:21,896 --> 01:00:25,896
...cringed out by me? Oh no, I cannot do this!

1013
01:00:39,896 --> 01:00:43,096
My name! You're saying my name! Is it working?

1014
01:00:43,096 --> 01:00:46,096
Tell me, children! Is the dragon being affected by me?

1015
01:00:47,896 --> 01:00:50,096
What is this? This power I'm feeling...

1016
01:00:52,296 --> 01:00:56,096
Oh no... It's surging in... in my veins...

1017
01:00:57,596 --> 01:01:02,096
Oh man... I feel it! Aaaaah yeah!

1018
01:01:02,596 --> 01:01:06,096
They don't call me the Fister for nothing!

1019
01:01:15,296 --> 01:01:17,896
That's me! The Fister!

1020
01:01:20,096 --> 01:01:23,296
Gigi Murin, Hololive English Justice!

1021
01:01:27,896 --> 01:01:30,096
I've done it!

1022
01:01:30,096 --> 01:01:32,096
Gigi Murin has done it!

1023
01:01:32,096 --> 01:01:34,296
I defeated the dragon!

1024
01:01:34,296 --> 01:01:36,096
I did it!

1025
01:01:36,096 --> 01:01:39,596
Ojisan, it was all thanks to you!

1026
01:01:39,596 --> 01:01:44,296
And the 15 children! But it was all thanks to you and the 15 children that I did it!

1027
01:01:44,296 --> 01:01:45,596
Yay!

1028
01:01:45,896 --> 01:01:49,096
Ojisan... Wait, you're still dead?

1029
01:01:49,096 --> 01:01:51,596
No! No!

1030
01:01:51,596 --> 01:01:55,896
I thought my power of dance could have saved you...

1031
01:02:04,596 --> 01:02:07,596
Ojisan, no...

1032
01:02:13,896 --> 01:02:17,596
Ojisan! You're okay!

1033
01:02:17,896 --> 01:02:21,096
The power of dance does save everyone!

1034
01:02:21,896 --> 01:02:24,896
You're okay, right? You're not possessed, are you?

1035
01:02:25,296 --> 01:02:27,596
Oh, what is this?

1036
01:02:28,096 --> 01:02:30,896
Oh, what are you doing?

1037
01:02:30,896 --> 01:02:36,596
Oh, what is happening? Oh god, what's- what's happening?

1038
01:02:40,596 --> 01:02:46,596
What the... What the heck is happening?

1039
01:02:46,596 --> 01:02:48,296
Ojisan?

1040
01:02:54,096 --> 01:02:57,096
Ojisan! You're okay!

1041
01:02:58,596 --> 01:03:02,096
I've done it! Yay!

1042
01:03:03,096 --> 01:03:08,096
Behold, the darkness has lifted from the dragon's soul.

1043
01:03:08,096 --> 01:03:12,096
My final desperate strike has shattered its cruel memories!

1044
01:03:12,096 --> 01:03:19,096
No longer a beast of fury, it has been reborn as an innocent baby dragon!

1045
01:03:25,596 --> 01:03:27,296
Ahem.

1046
01:03:32,096 --> 01:03:34,296
にっこり調査隊 おはこんばんちは how are you?
Smiley Investigation Team! Good morning, day, and night, how are you?

1047
01:03:34,296 --> 01:03:36,296
今日も今日とて最高です おぉ〜わんだほい!
Today is as awesome as ever! Oh~ Wonderhoi!

1048
01:03:36,296 --> 01:03:37,596
What the f—

1049
01:03:46,296 --> 01:03:48,096
いい笑顔をつくる
Making a nice smile!

1050
01:03:48,096 --> 01:03:50,096
笑うのは？ だけど笑顔をつくる
Laughing? But making a smile!

1051
01:03:50,096 --> 01:03:51,896
はい！隊長、俺に名案が！
Yes! Commander, I have a great idea!

1052
01:03:51,896 --> 01:03:53,596
却下！ てかまだ何も言ってないんだが？
Rejected! But I haven't even said anything yet?!

1053
01:03:53,596 --> 01:03:55,896
もーとにかくあれだほら カナブンは一見にしかず？
Gosh, anyways, you know, seeing a drone beetle is believing?

1054
01:03:55,896 --> 01:03:57,296
あぁ 百聞は一見に如かずだねぇ
Ah, seeing is believing, right?

1055
01:03:57,296 --> 01:03:58,296
それそれ！
That's it, that's it!

1056
01:03:58,296 --> 01:03:59,096
つまり虫取り？ 違うって！
So, bug catching? No, that's wrong!

1057
01:03:59,096 --> 01:04:00,096
隊長！ なになに〜
Commander! What is it~

1058
01:04:00,096 --> 01:04:01,296
提案があります ぜひ聞かせてほしいものだな
I have a proposal. I'd love to hear it.

1059
01:04:01,296 --> 01:04:02,296
とりあえず とりあえず？
For now... For now?

1060
01:04:02,296 --> 01:04:03,896
とりあえず出発しよう ノープランで
For now, let's depart with no plan!

1061
01:04:03,896 --> 01:04:04,896
うん！ ちょっと待って え？
Yup! Wait a second. Huh?

1062
01:04:04,896 --> 01:04:05,896
出発進行！
Full steam ahead!

1063
01:04:05,896 --> 01:04:07,596
ちょっと待ってって！旅支度くらいさせろ〜！
Wait a second! At least let me prepare for the trip~!

1064
01:04:07,596 --> 01:04:09,596
気を取り直して モチベチェック始めます！
Pulling ourselves together, let's start the motivation check!

1065
01:04:09,596 --> 01:04:11,296
まずは基本の パ パ パ パスポート持った？
First, the basics: did you bring your pass-pass-passport?

1066
01:04:11,296 --> 01:04:13,296
はーい！ 着替え忘れた！ えぇっ！？
Yes! I forgot extra clothes! What!?

1067
01:04:13,296 --> 01:04:15,596
モ モ モバイルバッテリー持った？
Did you bring a mobile battery?

1068
01:04:15,596 --> 01:04:17,596
はい！ 心差しは持った？ もちろん！
Yes! Did you bring your determination? Of course!

1069
01:04:17,596 --> 01:04:21,096
仲間がいて 私がいて
We have friends, we have me,

1070
01:04:21,096 --> 01:04:23,096
しかも普通じゃない
and we're not ordinary either.

1071
01:04:23,096 --> 01:04:24,596
誰のことかな？
Who could you be talking about?

1072
01:04:24,596 --> 01:04:27,596
僕らには不可能を可能に変える何かがあるさ
We have what it takes to turn the impossible into possible!

1073
01:04:27,596 --> 01:04:31,096
にっこりコリコリコリコリアンダー
Smiley, crunchy, coriander!

1074
01:04:31,096 --> 01:04:34,596
あちらもこちらも千客万来！
Everywhere we go, endless customers!

1075
01:04:34,596 --> 01:04:38,296
きみの笑顔もコレクションさせて
Let me add your smile to my collection too!

1076
01:04:38,296 --> 01:04:41,296
YEAH!

1077
01:04:41,296 --> 01:04:44,296
大人も子供も関係ねえぜ
It doesn't matter if you're an adult or a kid!

1078
01:04:44,296 --> 01:04:47,596
これぞ一流のエンターテインメント
This is first-class entertainment!

1079
01:04:47,596 --> 01:04:51,596
わたしだっていつか夢を叶えてやるって We can do it!
I'll make my dream come true someday too! We can do it!

1080
01:04:51,596 --> 01:04:58,096
このにっこりに触れて もっと胸膨らみましたとさ！
Tasting this smile filled my heart with even more excitement!

1081
