はい注目！
Attention, everyone!

1083
01:05:09,204 --> 01:05:11,204
にっこり調査隊 代々王者の仔
Smiley Survey Team, children of generational kings!

1084
01:05:11,204 --> 01:05:13,204
代々保つ調査の体裁
Maintaining the appearance of our survey for generations!

1085
01:05:13,204 --> 01:05:14,704
今だ悪を鉄拳制裁！
Now is the time to punish evil with an iron fist!

1086
