調査報告その一！
Survey Report Number 1!

1087
01:05:16,204 --> 01:05:17,304
エゴは全然違います！
Egos are completely different!

1088
01:05:17,304 --> 01:05:19,004
オバケも全然違います！
Ghosts are completely different, too!

1089
