ヤダ！めちゃ怖！
Oh no! That's super scary!

1090
01:05:20,204 --> 01:05:21,904
諸君！大変です！
Everyone! We have a big problem!

1091
01:05:21,904 --> 01:05:23,104
全然全然が足りてません！
We're completely, completely lacking everything!

1092
01:05:23,104 --> 01:05:24,204
とりあえず...
For now...

1093
01:05:24,204 --> 01:05:26,204
とりあえず... 待って じーっと見たな？
For now... Wait, you stared right at me, didn't you?

1094
01:05:26,204 --> 01:05:27,804
お前が言うな！
Look who's talking!

1095
01:05:27,804 --> 01:05:29,104
数日後
A few days later...

1096
01:05:29,104 --> 01:05:31,004
持ち物チェック始めまーす！
Starting the belongings check!

1097
01:05:31,004 --> 01:05:32,204
今夜いつものー
Tonight, as usual...

1098
01:05:32,204 --> 01:05:33,904
パ、パ、パスポート持った？
D-d-did you bring your passport?

1099
01:05:33,904 --> 01:05:34,604
はい！
Yes!

1100
01:05:34,604 --> 01:05:35,904
パンツ忘れた！
I forgot my underpants!

1101
01:05:35,904 --> 01:05:37,104
うわー！
Whoa!

1102
01:05:37,104 --> 01:05:38,804
モバイルバッテリー持った？
Did you bring a mobile battery?

1103
01:05:38,804 --> 01:05:39,604
はい！
Yes!

1104
01:05:39,604 --> 01:05:41,104
志は持った？
Do you have determination?

1105
01:05:41,104 --> 01:05:42,604
もっちろん！
Of course!

1106
01:05:42,604 --> 01:05:43,804
お国柄とか
Things like nationality...

1107
01:05:43,804 --> 01:05:45,104
老若男女は
or age and gender...

1108
01:05:45,104 --> 01:05:46,404
あんま関係ない！
don't really matter!

1109
01:05:46,404 --> 01:05:48,104
ワールドワイドだぜ！
We're worldwide, baby!

1110
01:05:48,104 --> 01:05:52,304
あっちも世界もまだまだすてたもんじゃないだってね！
Neither here nor the rest of the world are lost causes yet, right?

1111
01:05:52,304 --> 01:05:55,204
にっこりーりーりーりーお利口さん
Smiley-ley-ley-ley good kid,

1112
01:05:55,204 --> 01:05:58,004
陰キャも陽キャもウェルカム ウェルカム
introverts and extroverts alike, welcome, welcome!

1113
01:05:58,004 --> 01:06:00,304
君の笑顔が
Your smiling face...

1114
01:06:00,304 --> 01:06:02,404
調査対象さ！
is our survey target!

1115
01:06:02,404 --> 01:06:05,004
Yeah yeah yeah yeah!

1116
01:06:05,004 --> 01:06:06,204
メンタル doctors わけ cake
Mental doctors, sharing cake,

1117
01:06:06,204 --> 01:06:08,604
君の爆破のエンターテイナー
an entertainer for your explosions!

1118
01:06:08,604 --> 01:06:11,404
私だっていつか夢を叶えてやるって
I swear that one day I'm gonna fulfill my dreams!

1119
01:06:11,404 --> 01:06:13,604
We can do it!

1120
01:06:13,604 --> 01:06:16,204
このにっこりに触れて
Touching this smile,

1121
01:06:16,204 --> 01:06:19,504
もっと胸ふくらみましたとさ
my heart swelled up even more!

1122
01:06:19,504 --> 01:06:21,904
そのしょんぼりをにっこりに変換
Convert that sadness into smiles!

1123
01:06:21,904 --> 01:06:23,604
うちらのハセロメ
Our phase lock,

1124
01:06:23,604 --> 01:06:25,104
You, what's up?

1125
01:06:25,104 --> 01:06:26,604
あげの時だって
When feeling high,

1126
01:06:26,604 --> 01:06:27,804
さげの時だって
and when feeling low,

1127
01:06:27,804 --> 01:06:29,104
かき混ぜちゃって
mix it all together!

1128
01:06:29,104 --> 01:06:30,404
スパイスだって
Even the spices!

1129
01:06:30,404 --> 01:06:31,804
完璧だ！
It's perfect!

1130
01:06:31,804 --> 01:06:34,304
にっこりーりーりーりーお利口さん
Smiley-ley-ley-ley good kid,

1131
01:06:34,304 --> 01:06:37,104
大人も子供もナッツ＆サンデー
adults and children too, nuts & sundae!

1132
01:06:37,104 --> 01:06:40,904
もち我々も調査対象だー！
Of course, we are survey targets too!

1133
01:06:40,904 --> 01:06:43,704
Way way way way!

1134
01:06:43,704 --> 01:06:46,404
私だっていつか夢を叶えてやるって
I swear that one day I'm gonna fulfill my dreams!

1135
01:06:46,404 --> 01:06:47,404
We can do it!

1136
01:06:47,404 --> 01:06:50,104
このにっこりに触れて
Touching this smile,

1137
01:06:50,104 --> 01:06:53,404
もっと胸ふくらみましたとさ
my heart swelled up even more!

1138
01:06:57,704 --> 01:06:59,104
That's not all!

1139
01:06:59,104 --> 01:07:00,704
That's right! You didn't expect this!

1140
01:07:00,704 --> 01:07:02,104
Oh, you didn't expect this!

1141
01:07:03,104 --> 01:07:06,604
There's 3D MERCH! Yay!

1142
01:07:07,204 --> 01:07:11,904
You too! You watching at home can own your very own...

1143
01:07:12,104 --> 01:07:15,604
Grem Hand In Cushion! What does that mean?
Gremlin... Hand In Cushion! What does that mean?

1144
01:07:15,604 --> 01:07:18,204
You could put your hands in the Grem!
You can put your hands in the Gremlin!

1145
01:07:18,204 --> 01:07:22,604
You can remember all the good times that we had in the Grem Kingdom... Wait, Oji-san!
You can remember all the good times that we had in the Gremlin Kingdom... Wait, Ojisan!

1146
01:07:23,104 --> 01:07:25,904
Yay! Yay!

1147
01:07:26,104 --> 01:07:30,304
And you can do so many things with this Grem, like stick your hands in it, which I said!
And you can do so many things with this Gremlin, like stick your hands in it, which I said!

1148
01:07:30,304 --> 01:07:35,104
You can stick your hands in the Grem, and you can sleep on it, and you can squish it, and you can cherish it,
You can stick your hands in the Gremlin, and you can sleep on it, and you can squish it, and you can cherish it,

1149
01:07:35,104 --> 01:07:40,004
and you can love it, and it's very soft, and very squishy! Just watch Oji-san play with it! Doesn't that look cool?

1150
01:07:40,104 --> 01:07:44,304
3Dお披露目グッズの登場だー！ Yay!
Here comes the 3D debut merch! Yay!

1151
01:07:44,304 --> 01:07:49,104
見よ！このグレムのモチモチのハンドインクッションじゃよ！
Look! This is the squishy Grem Hand In Cushion!

1152
01:07:49,104 --> 01:07:50,204
So cute!

1153
01:07:50,904 --> 01:07:55,804
いっぱい可愛がっておくれよー！頼んだぞー！
Love it a lot, okay? I'm counting on you!

1154
01:07:56,104 --> 01:08:00,904
Yay!

1155
01:08:01,104 --> 01:08:04,304
Thank you everyone for coming to my 3D Live today!

1156
01:08:04,304 --> 01:08:08,904
I worked really, really hard on it, and thank you to the staff who was overseeing me!

1157
01:08:08,904 --> 01:08:13,204
And thank you for Oji-san for being here, and thank you for the Gremlins, and thank you for Calliope, and Nerissa,

1158
01:08:13,204 --> 01:08:18,104
and Bae, and Biboo, and Justice for being here, a part of my 3D live!

1159
01:08:18,204 --> 01:08:22,104
It was so much fun! Oh, it was so awesome! Thank you!

1160
01:08:22,104 --> 01:08:27,604
And I'm looking forward to doing more 3D things for you guys! Yay! Yippee!

1161
01:08:27,604 --> 01:08:31,604
And don't forget, there is MORE 3D debuts next week!

1162
01:08:32,104 --> 01:08:37,104
So make sure you tune in, because all of Justice has been working so hard, okay? Okay?

1163
01:08:38,104 --> 01:08:45,104
Bye everyone! See you later! Bye-bye!

1164
01:08:49,104 --> 01:08:52,104
[Grems, Thank you for being a part of my journey! It's been a crazy 1st year!]

1165
01:08:52,104 --> 01:08:56,104
[Sometimes it still doesn't feel real that I get to be here with you all,]

1166
01:08:56,104 --> 01:09:00,104
[and I'll never take this feeling for granted.]

1167
01:09:00,104 --> 01:09:04,104
[You are my passion! You are my strength!]

1168
01:09:04,104 --> 01:09:08,104
[I will keep working hard knowing that the shoebox will always be by my side.]

1169
01:09:08,104 --> 01:09:12,104
[I could say thank you a million times and it still wouldn't feel like enough.]

1170
01:09:12,104 --> 01:09:16,104
[But for all the times you've made me laugh, for the comfort you've brought me,]

1171
01:09:16,104 --> 01:09:20,104
[the community you've created, the joy you've shared, the stories you've crafted,]

1172
01:09:20,104 --> 01:09:24,104
[the whimsy that you keep alive in your heart, the shoebox that you take such good care of,]

1173
01:09:24,104 --> 01:09:28,104
[for always supporting me, THANK YOU <3]

